Z||000000||MooCow||04-21-2001||12:24 PM||||He wanted me to post pics of his car.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/JR_Feiro3.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/JR_Fiero1a.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/JR_Fiero2a.jpg"> <BR>Wow that is one nice Fiero.<P>                               Thanks Ken<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig.jpg"> <BR>87 GT, 3.4 engine with a 4:10 tranny, and Viper Yellow!||||reg||10
